WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:18.665
gasped as his companions began to look ill.

2
00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:23.706
The Tang Monk's head bobbed forward, and his teacup dropped from his hand.

3
00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.960
The monk toppled to the floor.

4
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:33.121
A moment later Wujing and Bajie passed out too.

5
00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:41.625
villain!" Wukong jumped to his feet and pulled out his iron bar.

6
00:00:42.445 --> 00:00:43.806
The priest backed away.

7
00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:49.128
Just then a door burst open, and the three women ran into the room.

8
00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.109
"You again?"

9
00:00:51.329 --> 00:00:52.089
cried the monkey.

10
00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.091
He leaped out of the way as the women shot webs at him.

11
00:00:56.971 --> 00:01:01.337
He jumped up, did a flip in the air, and landed directly behind the women.

12
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:05.059
Furiously, he slammed his iron bar down.

13
00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:08.521
There was a puff of smoke.

14
00:01:09.662 --> 00:01:13.864
When it cleared, a dead spider lay where one of the women had been.

15
00:01:15.005 --> 00:01:17.246
The other two women stared in horror.

16
00:01:17.266 --> 00:01:19.468
"He destroyed our sister!"

17
00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:20.348
cried one.

18
00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:22.209
"He's a monster!"

19
00:01:22.409 --> 00:01:23.090
cried the other.

20
00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.572
Wukong charged toward them.

21
00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:34.163
He knocked flying webs out of his way and then Bam!

22
00:01:34.463 --> 00:01:35.303
women were gone.

23
00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:38.865
In their places lay dead spiders.

24
00:01:40.145 --> 00:01:42.626
"Those spider spirits were my dear friends!"

25
00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:43.707
cried the priest.

26
00:01:45.288 --> 00:01:46.888
eyes burned with fury.

27
00:01:46.908 --> 00:01:49.509
"You will regret destroying them."

28
00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.912
The priest opened his robe, revealing a body covered in eyes.

29
00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:59.625
Suddenly, blinding light shot from the many eyes.

30
00:01:59.645 --> 00:02:04.626
"Aargh! The light is too bright!"

31
00:02:04.926 --> 00:02:05.667
cried the monkey.

32
00:02:06.987 --> 00:02:10.148
He covered his own eyes and ran all over the room.

33
00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:13.749
But he couldn't escape the blinding light.

34
00:02:14.829 --> 00:02:18.730
Finally he slammed his iron bar into the abbey's stone floor.

35
00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:21.211
huge hole opened up.

36
00:02:22.711 --> 00:02:27.196
The monkey jumped in and turned into a mole.

37
00:02:27.256 --> 00:02:31.759
Using his claws, he tunneled until he was sure he was far from the abbey.

38
00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.843
When Wukong popped up out of the ground, he turned back into himself.

39
00:02:37.944 --> 00:02:40.205
Bright light was shining from the abbey.

40
00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:44.508
Even from far away, the light burned the monkey's eyes.

41
00:02:45.669 --> 00:02:46.690
Wukong turned away.

42
00:02:48.431 --> 00:02:49.051
will I do?

43
00:02:49.072 --> 00:02:51.713
I have no way to save my friends.

44
00:02:52.554 --> 00:02:55.136
That priest's light is too powerful."

45
00:02:56.196 --> 00:03:01.018
sobbed and sobbed until he heard a voice say, "Don't cry, Wukong."

46
00:03:02.219 --> 00:03:03.039
monkey looked up.

47
00:03:03.739 --> 00:03:05.860
A tall woman was standing over him.

48
00:03:07.641 --> 00:03:10.142
"I am the bodhisattva Pralambra," said the woman.

49
00:03:10.162 --> 00:03:15.604
"That priest is a centipede spirit, called the Demon Lord of Many Eyes.

50
00:03:17.045 --> 00:03:19.566
I am the only one who can defeat him."

51
00:03:20.807 --> 00:03:23.648
Pralambra pulled a small needle from her sleeve.

52
00:03:24.452 --> 00:03:27.174
Turning, she threw the needle into the beams of light.

53
00:03:29.356 --> 00:03:33.419
The sound thundered in the sky, and the beams of light vanished.

54
00:03:36.721 --> 00:03:39.443
Wukong and Pralambra returned to the abbey.

55
00:03:41.004 --> 00:03:42.725
priest lay shaking on the floor.

56
00:03:43.646 --> 00:03:45.607
All of his eyes were squeezed shut.

57
00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:51.932
Pralambra pointed her finger at the priest, and he turned into a giant centipede.

58
00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.402
Pralambra took a bottle out of her sleeve.

59
00:03:55.422 --> 00:03:58.784
"Here, Wukong," said the bodhisattva.

60
00:03:59.465 --> 00:04:01.686
"These pills will cure your companions.

61
00:04:02.847 --> 00:04:05.529
I will take the centipede with me to be punished."

62
00:04:07.391 --> 00:04:08.332
Wukong bowed.

63
00:04:08.352 --> 00:04:09.913
"Thank you, Bodhisattva."

64
00:04:16.578 --> 00:04:19.220
The journey continued, and many weeks went by.

65
00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.902
"The journey has been easy lately," said the Tang Monk one day.

66
00:04:25.063 --> 00:04:26.003
Bajie snorted.

67
00:04:26.023 --> 00:04:29.345
"That's true," said Wujing.

68
00:04:29.905 --> 00:04:32.947
"It's been weeks since any demons tried to eat Master."

69
00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.530
"The Western Paradise is still far away," Wukong warned the others.

70
00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:41.892
"We'll face many more dangers before we get there."

71
00:04:43.193 --> 00:04:44.574
The Tang Monk smiled.

72
00:04:45.915 --> 00:04:48.116
Wukong, and enjoy the beautiful day.

73
00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.541
There is no danger here."

74
00:04:53.662 --> 00:04:55.643
then a man appeared up ahead.

75
00:04:56.864 --> 00:04:58.885
He was waving his arms frantically.

76
00:04:59.845 --> 00:05:01.066
"Don't come this way!"

77
00:05:01.306 --> 00:05:02.066
shouted the man.

78
00:05:02.086 --> 00:05:05.268
"There's danger ahead—great danger!"
